1) WEBSCRAPING
For the IMF speeches, the database is: https://www.imf.org/en/news/searchnews
To scrape the link for each webpage, we used IMF_scraping.R

2) SENTIMENT ANALYSIS
After the content is downloaded to each text file, the sentiments using finBERT algorithm is applied using Python file: finBERT.py

3) WORD CLOUD VISUALIZATION
Using the content of UN statements, wordcloud.R file is used to visualize word cloud. 


